  "description": "<p>This personalized racing area rug brings the excitement of the racetrack directly into your home. Featuring a detailed checkered-flag pattern and a lifelike race track design, this rug can be customized with a personal name or word. It is designed to add energy and action to various spaces, making it a distinctive accent piece.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Detailed racing theme with checkered flag and race track graphics</li>\n<li>Personalization option to add a custom name or word</li>\n<li>Soft yet durable polyester surface for comfort</li>\n<li>Non-slip rubber backing provides confident grip</li>\n<li>Versatile for use in game rooms, garages, or kids' spaces</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Game Room, Garage, Kid's Bedroom, Patio, Entry, Living Space</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Checkered</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Motorsports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Customization</td>\n<td>Text inputs for personalization</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This racing area rug is suitable for enhancing game rooms, garages, or children's bedrooms. Its versatile design also makes it a fitting addition to patios, entryways, or living spaces, perfect for racing enthusiasts or anyone looking to add a dynamic touch to their decor.</p>",
